  {
    "$comment": "Smithing: bars pay the tier's xp per bar (about 1.5× what mining the ore paid) and gear pays the same per bar in half the time, so smithing gear is the quicker route at the cost of more ore per hour. Silver and above also take a marble whetstone; spears and rods take a log for the shaft. Firemaking burns logs to ash. Cooking turns raw fish into food, burning some at low levels; each fish wants a hotter fire (a Firemaking level)."
